WEBVTT

00:24.190 --> 00:25.600
Your Highness, we've arrived.

00:32.980 --> 00:37.220
(Duke of Wei's Manor)

00:43.600 --> 00:44.912
- Welcome home,
- Welcome home,

00:44.944 --> 00:47.504
- Commandery Princess Zhaoning.
- Commandery Princess Zhaoning.

00:50.280 --> 00:51.240
I...

00:51.710 --> 00:53.390
greet Your Highness.

00:55.110 --> 00:56.150
Please rise, Uncle Qing.

00:57.110 --> 00:58.030
Your Highness.

00:58.032 --> 00:59.570
It's been many years since we last met,

00:59.584 --> 01:01.490
and you're still
as healthy and strong as ever.

01:01.880 --> 01:03.710
I've always been worried about

01:03.710 --> 01:05.590
the Duke, the Heir, and Your Highness

01:05.590 --> 01:07.480
so far away in the northwest.

01:08.150 --> 01:09.640
Greetings, Xihe.

01:10.940 --> 01:15.700
(Shen Yingruo,
the Duke of Wei's second daughter)

01:17.150 --> 01:17.840
Rise.

01:19.040 --> 01:20.790
This way, Your Highness.

01:27.420 --> 01:31.060
(Duke of Wei's Manor)

02:56.980 --> 02:57.824
=Blossoms of Power=

02:57.830 --> 03:00.580
(Adapted from the novel, After My
Bloom, All Flowers Wither by Jin Huang)

03:00.660 --> 03:03.620
=Episode 3=

03:04.750 --> 03:06.150
Jing was careless.

03:06.240 --> 03:07.190
Someone exposed him.

03:07.630 --> 03:10.432
(Xiao, the Duke of Wei's Concubine)
Shen Xihe is bound to suspect me.

03:10.960 --> 03:12.150
What should I do?

03:12.800 --> 03:13.840
She didn't die.

03:13.888 --> 03:15.600
What can she possibly do to you?

03:16.150 --> 03:17.470
Don't panic.

03:17.470 --> 03:19.300
(Fragrant Snow and Auspicious Clouds)

03:45.168 --> 03:47.040
Your Highness,
you've had a long journey.

03:47.250 --> 03:48.710
Why not return to your room and rest?

03:48.710 --> 03:49.360
Mo Yu,

03:50.190 --> 03:51.360
throw Xiao out.

03:51.840 --> 03:52.680
How dare you!

03:53.150 --> 03:54.400
Madam!

03:54.520 --> 03:56.000
How dare you lay a hand on me!

03:56.000 --> 03:58.016
Believe it or not,
I'll have your hand cut off!

03:58.750 --> 03:59.630
Shen Xihe,

03:59.960 --> 04:00.960
have you lost your mind?

04:00.960 --> 04:02.240
How dare you treat me like this!

04:03.710 --> 04:05.000
The eastern courtyard

04:05.190 --> 04:06.960
is reserved for the lady of the house.

04:07.430 --> 04:09.030
If you knew your place,

04:09.470 --> 04:11.310
you wouldn't
be humiliating yourself today.

04:13.280 --> 04:14.080
Uncle Qing,

04:14.710 --> 04:16.160
throw these servants

04:16.270 --> 04:17.270
and maids out as well.

04:17.870 --> 04:18.390
Yes.

04:18.950 --> 04:19.560
Men!

04:19.560 --> 04:20.510
Throw them all out.

04:21.190 --> 04:22.160
Let go of me!

04:23.070 --> 04:24.040
Let go!

04:24.050 --> 04:25.190
Please calm your anger, Xihe.

04:25.360 --> 04:26.480
Please leave Mother some...

04:28.000 --> 04:29.390
Who is your mother?

04:33.720 --> 04:35.310
Please spare the Concubine's dignity.

04:35.520 --> 04:37.760
I'll persuade
the Concubine to move out today.

04:39.830 --> 04:40.830
Don't beg her.

04:43.360 --> 04:45.370
Shen Xihe, you have
no respect for your elders

04:45.380 --> 04:46.360
and no regard for rank!

04:47.830 --> 04:48.630
My elders?

04:49.008 --> 04:51.690
I am Commandery Princess Zhaoning,
personally invested by His Majesty.

04:51.824 --> 04:53.750
You are nothing more
than my father's concubine.

04:53.780 --> 04:55.720
You didn't even bow before me,
yet I let it pass.

04:56.000 --> 04:57.430
And you dare lecture me about rank?

04:57.830 --> 04:59.270
I am Prince Kang's sister.

04:59.360 --> 05:01.488
The Marquis of Xuanping
is my maternal grandfather.

05:01.872 --> 05:04.336
Yingruo was also invested
as a County Princess by His Majesty.

05:04.360 --> 05:06.304
What gives you the right
to look down on us?

05:06.320 --> 05:07.570
Back then, my father was summoned

05:07.580 --> 05:09.270
to the imperial capital
to be rewarded by His Majesty.

05:09.280 --> 05:10.480
You bribed a palace attendant

05:10.870 --> 05:13.000
to drug the liquor
bestowed by His Majesty

05:13.800 --> 05:15.160
and got into his bed.

05:15.232 --> 05:17.104
My father refused
to take you as his concubine,

05:17.104 --> 05:19.536
so you had Prince Kang's Manor
secretly spread the rumor

05:19.552 --> 05:21.430
that he would
take you as his equal wife.

05:21.430 --> 05:22.640
The news reached the northwest.

05:23.800 --> 05:25.040
My mother was so distressed

05:25.360 --> 05:27.360
that she went
into labor at eight months.

05:27.510 --> 05:29.390
She died after giving birth to me.

05:30.190 --> 05:31.750
My father was devastated.

05:32.040 --> 05:33.430
He swore never to remarry.

05:34.360 --> 05:35.920
If you hadn't been carrying his child,

05:36.000 --> 05:38.432
you wouldn't even have been worthy
of becoming his concubine.

05:38.512 --> 05:39.720
You...

05:39.720 --> 05:40.310
Xihe,

05:40.680 --> 05:41.870
please calm your anger.

05:44.040 --> 05:45.510
Why are you kneeling to her?

05:49.750 --> 05:50.750
Shen Xihe,

05:52.360 --> 05:54.000
you humiliated me today.

05:54.288 --> 05:57.184
Do you think you'll have an easy life
in the imperial capital from now on?

05:59.720 --> 06:01.160
You've made an enemy of me today.

06:01.680 --> 06:04.390
Prince Kang's Manor
will make you repay this a thousandfold!

06:05.870 --> 06:07.190
An enemy?

06:07.630 --> 06:08.750
Not just today.

06:10.630 --> 06:11.830
Ling Long, the maid,

06:12.070 --> 06:13.000
works for you.

06:16.630 --> 06:17.920
Ling... Ling Long?

06:18.096 --> 06:19.920
I... I don't know
who you're talking about.

06:20.040 --> 06:22.160
She was the vile servant
who pushed me into the river

06:22.630 --> 06:24.950
under orders from you
and Prince Kang's Manor.

06:25.720 --> 06:27.750
How dare you falsely accuse me!

06:29.510 --> 06:30.680
If I had died,

06:31.100 --> 06:33.600
your daughter would've become
the Duke of Wei's only daughter.

06:33.984 --> 06:36.240
Then you could've risen in status
through your daughter.

06:36.870 --> 06:38.630
It was your only chance
to shed your status

06:38.630 --> 06:39.480
as a concubine.

06:40.240 --> 06:41.480
You and Prince Kang's Manor

06:41.600 --> 06:44.070
have always
been plotting to get rid of me.

06:46.950 --> 06:47.750
But

06:48.270 --> 06:49.360
you're not worthy

06:49.920 --> 06:50.870
of being my enemy.

06:51.680 --> 06:52.920
You wretch!

06:54.190 --> 06:55.270
Wretch!

06:55.408 --> 06:57.600
You looked so innocent and fragile
when you were little.

06:57.600 --> 06:59.070
It was all an act!

06:59.480 --> 07:01.240
You're incredibly scheming.

07:01.500 --> 07:03.040
You're even more venomous than a viper.

07:03.072 --> 07:04.830
As long as Prince Kang's Manor
still stands,

07:04.830 --> 07:06.500
I'll make sure
you die a miserable death.

07:06.510 --> 07:07.720
Enough!

07:08.160 --> 07:08.870
Take her away.

07:08.950 --> 07:09.920
Drive her out!

07:12.270 --> 07:13.040
Throw her out.

07:13.040 --> 07:14.384
- Take them all away.
- Move!

07:18.510 --> 07:19.190
Xihe,

07:19.560 --> 07:21.480
please spare the Concubine this once.

07:21.720 --> 07:22.870
Did you know

07:23.560 --> 07:24.560
about Ling Long?

07:25.600 --> 07:26.510
What do you mean?

07:30.390 --> 07:32.070
It seems you really knew nothing.

07:32.750 --> 07:33.830
Think carefully.

07:34.430 --> 07:35.680
Are you a Shen,

07:36.190 --> 07:37.190
or a Xiao?

07:46.912 --> 07:48.784
Your Highness,
by dealing with Xiao like this,

07:48.816 --> 07:50.270
I'm afraid you'll only make enemies.

07:50.270 --> 07:52.304
Have you ever seen
wolves keep company with dogs,

07:52.336 --> 07:53.408
or tigers walk with foxes?

07:54.240 --> 07:55.680
They're beneath me.

07:55.750 --> 07:57.248
There's no point wasting time on them.

08:04.390 --> 08:04.830
Let's go.

08:04.830 --> 08:05.240
Go.

08:07.220 --> 08:10.100
(Duke of Wei's Manor)

08:10.310 --> 08:11.720
She was really thrown out.

08:12.600 --> 08:13.680
Have you heard?

08:13.750 --> 08:14.830
All these years,

08:15.000 --> 08:17.270
everyone thought
she was the Duke's wife.

08:17.630 --> 08:19.190
Turns out she was only a concubine.

08:19.190 --> 08:20.040
Goodness.

08:20.040 --> 08:21.310
She was really thrown out.

08:21.310 --> 08:22.560
How humiliating.

08:24.750 --> 08:26.830
How can anyone be so bold?

08:27.720 --> 08:29.510
Xiao is still a favored concubine.

08:29.936 --> 08:32.120
How could they throw her
out of the manor like this?

08:34.680 --> 08:35.424
I rather admire

08:35.430 --> 08:37.790
Commandery Princess Zhaoning's spirit
of settling every score

08:37.790 --> 08:39.520
and refusing to be taken advantage of.

08:41.910 --> 08:43.440
Compared with those meek

08:43.488 --> 08:44.896
and long-suffering young ladies,

08:44.976 --> 08:46.224
the commandery princess

08:46.670 --> 08:48.510
is rare for her strength and courage.

08:49.270 --> 08:50.910
This is clearly ruthless

08:51.000 --> 08:51.910
and merciless.

08:52.390 --> 08:54.480
How did it become strength
and courage to you?

08:56.390 --> 08:57.320
Speaking of which,

08:57.440 --> 08:59.480
the commandery princess
will soon meet the princes.

08:59.910 --> 09:00.840
Who do you think

09:01.030 --> 09:02.510
she'll give the Rouge Ledger to?

09:08.240 --> 09:09.720
She will surely give it to me.

09:11.540 --> 09:14.820
(Chenning Hall)

09:16.320 --> 09:17.080
Your Majesty.

09:18.120 --> 09:20.120
(Xiao Juechong, Emperor Youning)
By all rights,

09:20.256 --> 09:23.152
the Crown Prince should come
to the palace to pay his respects.

09:23.790 --> 09:26.720
Yet Your Majesty is personally
visiting the Eastern Palace.

09:28.360 --> 09:30.510
Huayong has been frail since childhood.

09:30.800 --> 09:33.120
This journey back to the palace
must have been exhausting.

09:33.390 --> 09:33.960
I...

09:35.270 --> 09:37.750
truly don't want him to be too tired.

09:39.000 --> 09:40.790
I'll go prepare at once

09:40.790 --> 09:42.190
for the visit to the Eastern Palace.

09:50.000 --> 09:52.150
His Majesty has arrived.

09:54.510 --> 09:56.480
Father.

09:56.480 --> 09:58.000
My Huayong has returned.

09:59.480 --> 10:00.030
I already

10:00.960 --> 10:02.790
exempted you
from these formalities, didn't I?

10:11.790 --> 10:12.320
Come.

10:21.120 --> 10:21.910
Huayong,

10:22.224 --> 10:23.670
now that you're back in the palace,

10:23.670 --> 10:24.550
if anything happens,

10:24.670 --> 10:26.550
send someone to inform me at once.

10:27.320 --> 10:28.000
Father,

10:29.480 --> 10:30.910
ever since Mother passed away,

10:31.840 --> 10:33.150
you issued a decree

10:33.184 --> 10:35.152
never to appoint
another Empress in this lifetime.

10:35.480 --> 10:36.720
I understand

10:37.550 --> 10:38.320
that you did it so

10:38.320 --> 10:40.928
no one could shake my position
as Crown Prince of the Eastern Palace.

10:40.960 --> 10:42.720
You also made all the princes' names

10:43.376 --> 10:44.870
avoid "Hua" and change to "Chang,"

10:45.150 --> 10:46.630
so they would not conflict with mine.

10:47.630 --> 10:49.480
My daily provisions are also

10:49.600 --> 10:50.720
arranged to match Father's.

10:51.480 --> 10:52.240
But I

10:53.440 --> 10:55.080
sometimes truly do not understand.

10:55.616 --> 10:57.000
Why would someone as frail as I am

10:57.440 --> 11:00.000
receive such generous care
and protection from Father?

11:01.120 --> 11:02.270
Huayong.

11:02.960 --> 11:03.870
I...

11:05.270 --> 11:06.670
still remember

11:08.320 --> 11:10.910
you with your hair in two buns.

11:11.440 --> 11:13.080
So innocent and carefree.

11:15.630 --> 11:18.360
You were exceptionally gifted
from a young age.

11:19.630 --> 11:21.390
Whatever you learned,

11:21.720 --> 11:22.910
you never forgot it

11:23.080 --> 11:24.270
and mastered it with ease.

11:25.200 --> 11:28.150
You were hailed
as an unparalleled prodigy.

11:29.510 --> 11:30.670
You are my

11:32.000 --> 11:33.670
most beloved son.

11:35.720 --> 11:36.510
Huayong,

11:37.510 --> 11:39.120
don't overthink it.

11:40.360 --> 11:41.150
Just...

11:41.670 --> 11:43.720
focus on recovering.

11:44.320 --> 11:44.960
Only then

11:46.270 --> 11:48.750
can I entrust the realm

11:48.870 --> 11:50.120
to you.

11:56.630 --> 11:57.790
Thank you, Father.

11:59.180 --> 12:02.940
(Auspicious Radiance)

12:09.320 --> 12:10.120
Tian Yuan,

12:10.840 --> 12:14.240
what really happened back then?

12:14.670 --> 12:15.270
Your Highness,

12:15.584 --> 12:17.320
when the case
was thoroughly investigated,

12:17.504 --> 12:19.984
after Steward Zhao
of the Palace Food Bureau confessed,

12:20.000 --> 12:21.390
she suddenly died in prison.

12:22.200 --> 12:23.510
The case became unsolved,

12:23.792 --> 12:25.030
with no evidence left behind.

12:30.030 --> 12:32.670
This poison was made from
more than a dozen exotic toxins.

12:34.200 --> 12:35.600
It wouldn't kill at once,

12:36.670 --> 12:38.670
but would make its victim suffer

12:39.080 --> 12:41.000
excruciating pain day after day.

12:42.270 --> 12:43.750
I must find out

12:44.080 --> 12:45.630
who this person really is,

12:46.390 --> 12:48.150
and why they poisoned me.

12:49.000 --> 12:50.270
So close to Father,

12:51.390 --> 12:52.670
yet hidden within the court.

12:53.150 --> 12:54.840
It must be someone of great power

12:54.840 --> 12:56.480
to have stayed hidden for so long.

12:57.500 --> 12:58.790
If I don't uncover this person,

12:59.270 --> 13:00.510
they'll remain a grave threat

13:00.790 --> 13:02.750
to Father and the realm.

13:03.910 --> 13:04.910
They must be eliminated.

13:22.120 --> 13:23.630
Greetings, Your Majesty.

13:23.696 --> 13:25.088
Greetings, Grand Empress Dowager.

13:25.120 --> 13:26.500
May Your Majesty
be blessed with good health.

13:26.510 --> 13:27.740
May Grand Empress Dowager
be blessed with good health.

13:27.750 --> 13:29.824
No need for formalities,
Commandery Princess Zhaoning.

13:29.870 --> 13:30.720
Rise.

13:30.768 --> 13:33.488
(Grand Empress Dowager Meng)
Thank you, Your Majesty, and Grand Empress Dowager.

13:34.510 --> 13:36.910
Your father has sent you
to the imperial capital.

13:37.120 --> 13:40.240
I will take good care of you.

13:40.550 --> 13:41.670
From today onward,

13:41.728 --> 13:43.340
your food, clothing,
and daily provisions

13:43.390 --> 13:45.024
shall follow the rank of a princess.

13:46.080 --> 13:47.312
Thank you, Your Majesty.

13:51.540 --> 13:53.740
(Consort Liang)

13:54.020 --> 13:55.820
(Noble Consort Rong)

14:26.320 --> 14:28.120
Prince Yu has arrived.

14:41.720 --> 14:44.630
I wish Father and Grandmother

14:44.650 --> 14:45.750
good health and a long life.

14:46.048 --> 14:47.472
May you enjoy eight thousand springs,

14:47.670 --> 14:48.870
and eight thousand autumns.

14:50.150 --> 14:51.030
Changyu,

14:51.550 --> 14:53.390
you're always late.

14:53.720 --> 14:54.510
Take a seat.

15:08.000 --> 15:10.220
Your Highness has traveled
all the way from the northwest.

15:10.240 --> 15:11.150
You must be exhausted.

15:11.270 --> 15:12.480
Allow me to offer you a toast.

15:13.750 --> 15:14.960
Thank you, Prince Yu.

15:22.270 --> 15:22.960
Your Highness,

15:23.870 --> 15:24.870
the imperial capital

15:25.150 --> 15:26.510
has many delightful places.

15:27.000 --> 15:28.480
If Your Highness has the time,

15:28.960 --> 15:30.320
allow me to be your guide.

15:30.510 --> 15:32.270
May I show Your Highness
around the capital?

15:32.510 --> 15:34.550
I wouldn't dare trouble Prince Yu.

15:34.630 --> 15:35.910
It would be

15:36.630 --> 15:38.000
my honor.

15:39.510 --> 15:40.790
Your Majesty, look.

15:40.800 --> 15:43.120
Changyu and the commandery princess
seem to have hit it off.

15:43.136 --> 15:45.136
They just met,
and they're already getting along.

15:45.670 --> 15:48.360
I've long heard Commandery Princess
Zhaoning is a peerless beauty.

15:48.720 --> 15:49.840
Now that I've seen her,

15:50.030 --> 15:51.600
I can't take my eyes off her.

15:52.270 --> 15:53.750
She's a delight to behold.

15:56.200 --> 15:56.960
Your Majesty,

15:58.000 --> 15:58.910
just look.

15:59.000 --> 16:00.750
They're all speaking
with hidden motives.

16:01.150 --> 16:02.480
They all want Zhaoning

16:02.630 --> 16:04.670
as their daughter-in-law.

16:13.790 --> 16:15.150
I have a request.

16:15.150 --> 16:16.380
I ask Your Majesty to grant it.

16:16.440 --> 16:17.600
Speak freely.

16:18.150 --> 16:19.320
The husband I marry

16:20.000 --> 16:21.550
must be the one I love.

16:22.200 --> 16:27.200
So you intend
to choose your own husband?

16:27.440 --> 16:29.600
I wish to marry a man

16:29.600 --> 16:31.120
who knows and cherishes me,

16:31.320 --> 16:32.750
so we may share a happy marriage.

16:33.390 --> 16:34.670
If husband and wife are at odds,

16:34.750 --> 16:37.030
the household will know no peace.

16:37.360 --> 16:40.200
At worst, it will drive a wedge
between the two families.

16:40.720 --> 16:42.000
The Shen family has been honored

16:42.000 --> 16:43.690
with a marriage
into the imperial family.

16:43.800 --> 16:45.808
Such a matter
must be considered with great care.

16:46.120 --> 16:47.510
My only wish is to marry for love.

16:47.856 --> 16:49.872
I ask Your Majesty to grant my request.

16:51.150 --> 16:52.030
Zhaoning,

16:53.000 --> 16:54.150
let me ask you this.

16:54.150 --> 16:56.000
What if the man you love

16:56.000 --> 16:57.550
doesn't love you back?

16:57.720 --> 16:59.080
What would you do?

16:59.240 --> 17:01.240
I would respect the prince's wishes.

17:01.600 --> 17:02.360
Zhaoning,

17:02.910 --> 17:04.200
after saying that,

17:04.480 --> 17:07.720
aren't you afraid you'll become
the laughingstock of the entire palace?

17:07.880 --> 17:08.920
Grand Empress Dowager,

17:09.920 --> 17:11.960
to care about what others say and think

17:12.070 --> 17:13.110
is to imprison myself.

17:13.110 --> 17:14.310
That's not who I am.

17:15.200 --> 17:16.790
I seek mutual love.

17:16.880 --> 17:18.480
The princes should have the same wish.

17:19.110 --> 17:20.200
I'm certain

17:20.200 --> 17:21.750
I'll find the right man.

17:22.830 --> 17:23.510
Father,

17:24.848 --> 17:26.270
the commandery princess has vision,

17:26.270 --> 17:27.030
courage,

17:27.240 --> 17:28.030
and magnanimity.

17:28.590 --> 17:30.510
She truly proves women
are no less than men.

17:31.070 --> 17:33.030
I'd like to ask Father to grant

17:33.510 --> 17:34.890
the commandery princess's request.

17:39.480 --> 17:40.720
I grant it.

17:41.960 --> 17:44.550
Once you've chosen

17:44.720 --> 17:47.510
the right husband
from among the princes,

17:48.880 --> 17:51.510
I will arrange the marriage.

17:51.510 --> 17:53.030
The whole realm will know of it.

17:53.750 --> 17:55.030
Thank you, Your Majesty.

18:11.590 --> 18:12.680
Your remarks

18:12.790 --> 18:14.110
in the hall just now

18:14.240 --> 18:15.510
truly impressed me.

18:16.600 --> 18:17.790
You flatter me, Your Highness.

18:17.888 --> 18:19.590
Since you wish
to choose your own husband,

18:19.880 --> 18:22.030
how much do you know about my brothers?

18:22.976 --> 18:24.880
I've only just arrived
in the imperial capital.

18:25.310 --> 18:26.510
I don't know much about them.

18:29.070 --> 18:30.070
In that case,

18:30.790 --> 18:32.720
let me tell you a little about them.

18:32.720 --> 18:33.504
What do you say?

18:33.640 --> 18:34.590
I'd be glad to hear.

18:37.232 --> 18:39.350
There are currently
five princes of marriageable age.

18:39.376 --> 18:40.920
My second brother is Xiao Changmin.

18:41.440 --> 18:42.720
His wife, Lady Yu,

18:42.720 --> 18:43.960
passed away a few years ago.

18:44.400 --> 18:45.640
He has never remarried.

18:46.000 --> 18:48.000
The Yu family
still treats him like a son-in-law.

18:48.070 --> 18:49.510
The two families remain close.

18:49.568 --> 18:51.110
My fifth brother is Xiao Changqing,

18:51.110 --> 18:52.630
and my ninth brother is Xiao Changying.

18:52.640 --> 18:54.400
Their mother is Noble Consort Rong.

18:54.520 --> 18:56.270
Their uncle,
the Duke of Ying, guards Anlan.

18:56.350 --> 18:58.016
He commands a hundred thousand cavalry.

18:58.070 --> 18:59.376
My sixth brother is Xiao Changyu,

18:59.408 --> 19:00.544
a man of immortal grace.

19:01.070 --> 19:03.500
His mother, Consort Liang,
is unmatched in the inner palace.

19:03.640 --> 19:05.270
Ye Qi, Commander-in-Chief of Hexi,

19:05.640 --> 19:06.790
is Consort Liang's cousin.

19:07.350 --> 19:10.030
(These princes are backed
either by powerful families)

19:10.030 --> 19:11.400
(or wield military power.)

19:11.880 --> 19:13.960
(That means
too many people rely on them.)

19:14.720 --> 19:16.590
(Entrusting the Rouge Ledger
to any of them)

19:16.790 --> 19:17.880
(wouldn't be prudent.)

19:23.424 --> 19:24.790
Your Highness is truly fortunate.

19:26.160 --> 19:27.960
Whoever you marry

19:28.048 --> 19:29.270
will make a wonderful match.

19:31.070 --> 19:33.030
Why don't you
introduce yourself, Your Highness?

19:36.110 --> 19:37.440
I'm different.

19:38.920 --> 19:40.480
I've been away from court for years.

19:40.480 --> 19:41.550
All alone.

19:41.960 --> 19:43.350
Just a frail,

19:43.510 --> 19:44.680
overlooked,

19:44.920 --> 19:46.200
idle Crown Prince.

19:47.000 --> 19:48.960
Your Highness holds
the position of Crown Prince.

19:49.072 --> 19:50.550
You enjoy His Majesty's favor.

19:50.960 --> 19:51.960
You're far too modest.

19:54.768 --> 19:56.160
Thank you for your kind words.

19:58.400 --> 19:59.960
Do you still remember our agreement?

20:00.440 --> 20:02.260
Let's meet at
the Eastern Palace another day.

20:03.270 --> 20:04.550
I'll be there.

20:20.350 --> 20:22.110
Why didn't Prince Lie
send a calling card?

20:22.110 --> 20:22.680
Answer me.

20:23.750 --> 20:25.000
Where is the Rouge Ledger now?

20:25.590 --> 20:26.750
Prince Lie needn't ask.

20:27.200 --> 20:28.720
I'll give it to the right person.

20:29.110 --> 20:29.750
Who is it?

20:30.750 --> 20:32.070
Which prince has won your favor?

20:32.100 --> 20:33.200
That's none of your concern.

20:34.510 --> 20:35.720
May I ask, Prince Lie,

20:35.790 --> 20:36.830
if the Rouge Ledger

20:36.830 --> 20:38.720
contains members
of Noble Consort Rong's family,

20:38.880 --> 20:40.680
could you truly
set personal feelings aside

20:40.830 --> 20:41.880
and uphold justice?

20:42.000 --> 20:43.030
Just answer me.

20:43.400 --> 20:44.920
Which prince has won your favor?

20:45.160 --> 20:46.030
Is it Changyu?

20:46.784 --> 20:47.590
See the guest out.

20:48.030 --> 20:48.510
Wait.

20:54.480 --> 20:56.750
This was your favorite

20:56.960 --> 20:58.920
when you came to the imperial capital

20:59.110 --> 21:00.480
with your father as a child.

21:01.070 --> 21:01.720
Give it a try.

21:01.720 --> 21:02.980
(Tao Zhuanxian, Shen Xihe's
Maternal Grandfather, Censor)

21:05.020 --> 21:06.260
(Tao Yuan, Shen Xihe's Uncle)

21:06.340 --> 21:07.580
(Madam Zhang, Shen Xihe's Aunt)

21:10.720 --> 21:11.720
Isn't it good?

21:15.960 --> 21:18.110
You drove Xiao out of the manor?

21:20.350 --> 21:21.510
She's now

21:21.720 --> 21:24.160
back at Prince Kang's Manor.

21:24.880 --> 21:27.070
If she gives you any more trouble,

21:27.070 --> 21:29.110
you must tell me.

21:30.830 --> 21:32.880
Aren't you afraid
of offending Prince Kang's Manor?

21:33.000 --> 21:33.880
Afraid?

21:34.640 --> 21:35.750
Afraid of what?

21:36.110 --> 21:38.920
Ever since Xiao
caused my daughter to die,

21:38.920 --> 21:40.720
I'm afraid of nothing.

21:41.720 --> 21:42.960
All these years,

21:42.960 --> 21:44.830
I've stood against Prince Kang.

21:44.830 --> 21:46.880
I've never forgotten to seek justice

21:46.880 --> 21:48.830
for my daughter.

21:48.830 --> 21:50.070
They may have forgotten

21:50.070 --> 21:51.110
my sister's life,

21:52.030 --> 21:53.270
but the Tao family

21:53.510 --> 21:54.270
never has.

21:58.160 --> 21:59.880
Thank you, Grandfather and Uncle.

22:00.030 --> 22:01.270
I've grown up.

22:01.728 --> 22:03.550
The blood debt
owed by Prince Kang's Manor,

22:04.160 --> 22:05.680
I should be the one to make them pay.

22:06.200 --> 22:08.510
Xihe, you've only just arrived
in the imperial capital.

22:08.720 --> 22:10.240
Countless eyes are on you.

22:10.640 --> 22:12.510
You mustn't act rashly.

22:13.350 --> 22:15.920
As long as my father and brother
remain in the northwest,

22:16.400 --> 22:17.750
no matter how unhappy they are,

22:17.840 --> 22:18.880
they'll have to endure it.

22:19.030 --> 22:20.240
Don't forget,

22:20.750 --> 22:23.480
you still have
the Tao family behind you.

22:24.110 --> 22:24.830
That's right.

22:27.400 --> 22:28.160
Your Highness,

22:28.192 --> 22:29.510
Prince Yu requests an audience.

22:31.640 --> 22:32.510
Xihe,

22:32.920 --> 22:34.960
are you acquainted with Prince Yu?

22:35.400 --> 22:37.880
I only met him once at today's banquet.

22:37.880 --> 22:38.720
Then...

22:39.440 --> 22:41.310
why would he come all the way here?

22:41.960 --> 22:42.880
I don't know either.

22:44.440 --> 22:46.160
Please invite Prince Yu inside.

22:46.550 --> 22:47.070
Yes.

22:48.032 --> 22:49.880
- Greetings, Prince Yu.
- Greetings, Prince Yu.

22:49.880 --> 22:50.640
You may all rise.

22:52.310 --> 22:53.200
Your Highness as well.

22:54.576 --> 22:56.110
Your Highness has traveled a long way.

22:56.110 --> 22:57.950
I'm afraid you may not
have brought everything you need.

22:57.968 --> 22:59.760
I'd like to offer
a small token of my regard.

22:59.770 --> 23:01.650
I didn't expect Master Tao
to be here as well.

23:01.664 --> 23:02.912
I hope Master Tao doesn't mind.

23:02.960 --> 23:04.270
Of course not.

23:06.960 --> 23:09.640
Prince Yu presents
Commandery Princess Zhaoning

23:09.790 --> 23:12.510
with a glazed incense burner set
with milk-nail pattern.

23:12.510 --> 23:14.656
(Imperial Apothecary)
One box of the finest incense.

23:16.200 --> 23:18.880
This is an access token
to the Imperial Apothecary.

23:18.912 --> 23:20.980
From now on, whatever incense
Your Highness requires,

23:20.992 --> 23:22.480
just have your servants fetch it.

23:26.680 --> 23:27.790
Thank you, Prince Yu.

23:29.920 --> 23:32.830
Prince Yu also presents
Commandery Princess Zhaoning

23:32.830 --> 23:34.640
with ten bolts of Mingxia Brocade.

23:34.640 --> 23:35.590
This Mingxia Brocade

23:35.830 --> 23:37.590
was offered as tribute
by the Nvman Kingdom.

23:37.600 --> 23:40.000
Its radiant luster and rich fragrance
are truly exceptional.

23:40.200 --> 23:42.830
I had it specially prepared
for Your Highness in advance.

23:43.160 --> 23:45.880
Prince Yu also presents
Commandery Princess Zhaoning

23:45.880 --> 23:47.830
with ten pomegranate lip rouges,

23:47.830 --> 23:49.830
ten boxes of rose face powder,

23:49.830 --> 23:51.110
and a string of northern pearls

23:51.110 --> 23:53.550
for Your Highness's toilette.

23:53.550 --> 23:55.030
Prince Yu is so generous.

23:55.270 --> 23:56.550
How could I ever repay you?

23:56.608 --> 23:57.960
Your Highness needn't be so polite.

23:58.350 --> 23:59.200
These things

23:59.328 --> 24:00.880
are just a small token of my regard.

24:02.720 --> 24:04.070
Thank you, Prince Yu.

24:06.440 --> 24:07.750
It's getting late today.

24:08.110 --> 24:09.590
Perhaps we should meet another day.

24:14.112 --> 24:15.680
You are quite right, Your Highness.

24:15.750 --> 24:18.336
Master Tao and Your Highness
have just reunited after so long.

24:19.168 --> 24:20.550
Then I won't disturb you.

24:20.720 --> 24:21.952
I'll take my leave.

24:29.550 --> 24:31.160
I heard His Majesty

24:31.270 --> 24:32.720
intends to choose a husband for you.

24:34.240 --> 24:36.590
Prince Yu was so attentive today.

24:36.590 --> 24:37.440
Does he

24:37.680 --> 24:39.030
intend to marry you?

24:39.280 --> 24:41.216
I've only just arrived
in the imperial capital.

24:41.310 --> 24:43.880
I don't know much about the princes yet.

24:44.030 --> 24:45.000
I cannot decide.

24:45.920 --> 24:47.160
The sons of the imperial family

24:48.160 --> 24:49.400
are all far from simple.

24:50.000 --> 24:51.270
Choosing a husband

24:51.440 --> 24:52.640
must be done with great care.

24:55.500 --> 24:57.700
(Prince Xin's Manor)

25:16.510 --> 25:17.160
Changqing,

25:18.500 --> 25:20.110
your wife has been gone for three years.

25:20.960 --> 25:22.030
Why do this to yourself?

25:23.880 --> 25:25.310
What it feels like to love someone,

25:26.830 --> 25:27.960
you didn't understand before.

25:31.200 --> 25:32.720
But soon you will.

25:34.070 --> 25:35.270
You want to get close

25:35.712 --> 25:37.552
to Commandery Princess Zhaoning,

25:37.720 --> 25:38.830
yet you don't dare.

25:39.400 --> 25:40.640
You want to show her kindness,

25:41.200 --> 25:42.510
yet you don't know how.

25:44.640 --> 25:45.750
The day she saved me,

25:47.270 --> 25:48.350
I remembered her.

25:50.070 --> 25:51.310
When she stole the Rouge Ledger,

25:51.640 --> 25:52.590
I was angry,

25:53.110 --> 25:54.440
but I never truly blamed her.

25:56.400 --> 25:57.680
When I went to see her today,

25:57.960 --> 25:59.440
it confirmed what I had suspected.

25:59.450 --> 26:01.232
The commandery princess
took the Rouge Ledger

26:01.248 --> 26:03.296
to give it to someone
who would uphold justice.

26:03.830 --> 26:04.480
Changqing,

26:04.830 --> 26:06.070
you needn't pave the way for me.

26:06.912 --> 26:08.752
What the commandery princess is doing

26:09.310 --> 26:10.720
is also what I wish to do.

26:20.480 --> 26:21.920
You've truly fallen for her.

26:24.030 --> 26:25.070
I will help you.

26:25.480 --> 26:26.790
I don't need your help.

26:27.270 --> 26:28.880
The one you love is hard to come by.

26:30.880 --> 26:32.510
Don't follow in my footsteps.

26:37.160 --> 26:39.030
I don't want to see you
become who you are now.

26:39.240 --> 26:40.880
My brother was once my greatest pride.

26:40.960 --> 26:42.256
He was the man I admired most.

26:42.260 --> 26:44.250
He was full of ambition,
always in complete command.

26:44.260 --> 26:46.390
Yet now, his eyes are filled
with the weariness of life.

26:46.400 --> 26:48.260
He appears to have
found peace and contentment.

26:48.680 --> 26:49.510
But in truth,

26:50.336 --> 26:52.032
he has simply grown tired of living.

26:56.000 --> 26:56.960
I once wondered,

26:57.408 --> 26:59.790
(The Late Lady Gu)
why I could never warm Qingzhi's heart.

27:00.440 --> 27:01.480
I felt wronged,

27:02.200 --> 27:03.110
lost,

27:04.110 --> 27:05.030
and tormented.

27:06.480 --> 27:07.960
It wasn't until she passed away

27:10.920 --> 27:12.270
that I finally understood.

27:14.790 --> 27:16.240
Everything I gave

27:19.720 --> 27:21.310
was nothing more than unrequited love.

27:23.550 --> 27:25.200
What right did I have

27:28.944 --> 27:30.752
to expect her to return my feelings?

27:34.270 --> 27:35.030
Changqing,

27:38.400 --> 27:39.480
let her go.

27:49.480 --> 27:50.310
I can't.

27:53.830 --> 27:54.720
Changying,

27:55.790 --> 27:57.270
I'm telling you this

27:59.590 --> 28:01.110
because I hope you'll discover

28:02.160 --> 28:04.440
what Commandery Princess Zhaoning
truly wants.

28:06.200 --> 28:07.240
Don't let it slip away,

28:07.424 --> 28:08.880
and don't make the wrong choice.

28:10.640 --> 28:12.310
I hope you'll find

28:16.030 --> 28:17.750
the happiness I never had.

28:40.272 --> 28:40.920
Your Highness,

28:41.104 --> 28:42.608
the commandery princess has arrived.

28:46.590 --> 28:47.310
You're here.

28:48.030 --> 28:49.200
I thought you weren't coming.

28:50.880 --> 28:52.640
Your Highness.

28:53.408 --> 28:54.510
No need for formalities.

28:54.560 --> 28:55.880
The wind is strong out here.

28:56.070 --> 28:57.200
Let's talk inside.

28:57.270 --> 28:57.720
Please.

29:09.830 --> 29:11.790
The Crown Prince
truly has a gentle disposition.

29:11.860 --> 29:14.030
He carries the grace
and refinement of a royal prince,

29:14.040 --> 29:16.870
yet none of the arrogance so often found
among those born to the throne.

29:18.600 --> 29:19.720
Your Highness, what's wrong?

29:21.000 --> 29:22.160
I'm not afraid of bad people.

29:22.320 --> 29:24.240
I'm especially good
at fighting evil with evil.

29:25.000 --> 29:26.480
But when it comes to good people,

29:26.880 --> 29:28.160
I never quite know what to do.

29:30.704 --> 29:32.750
Commandery princess, this way, please.

29:43.300 --> 29:45.312
Every flower and plant
in Your Highness's residence

29:45.440 --> 29:46.720
is a rare and precious treasure.

29:47.510 --> 29:49.070
You even diverted hot spring water here.

29:49.120 --> 29:50.590
The flowers bloom in splendid beauty

29:50.590 --> 29:51.990
through every season without fading.

29:54.790 --> 29:56.350
You clearly know your flowers.

29:56.360 --> 29:57.960
When did you develop
such refined tastes?

29:58.270 --> 29:59.590
You're too kind, Your Highness.

30:00.200 --> 30:01.590
I've loved flowers and plants

30:01.590 --> 30:02.750
ever since I was a child.

30:03.400 --> 30:04.270
What a coincidence.

30:05.440 --> 30:08.384
I've loved growing flowers and tending
plants since childhood as well.

30:08.400 --> 30:10.470
From now on, you are always
welcome at the East Palace

30:10.480 --> 30:11.712
to admire the beauty of flowers

30:11.728 --> 30:13.568
and appreciate the charm
of nature together.

30:14.680 --> 30:15.880
(Commandery princess,)

30:16.160 --> 30:18.640
(do you know
how this garden came to be?)

30:33.590 --> 30:35.590
(I've put so much into it.)

31:16.070 --> 31:17.350
Commandery princess, please.

31:27.110 --> 31:29.440
The tea glows with a bright apricot hue,

31:30.440 --> 31:32.270
and its fragrance
is light and refreshing.

31:33.270 --> 31:34.550
Preparing tea, burning incense,

31:34.560 --> 31:36.330
arranging flowers,
and displaying paintings.

31:36.384 --> 31:38.110
Tea is what I do best.

31:40.000 --> 31:40.590
Your Highness,

31:41.030 --> 31:41.750
this tea

31:42.030 --> 31:44.350
is Wuyang tea personally grown
by Crown Prince.

31:44.920 --> 31:46.720
Your Highness grows tea yourself?

31:49.310 --> 31:50.310
When I was young,

31:51.790 --> 31:53.070
I fell gravely ill.

31:54.464 --> 31:57.184
I could neither excel in academics
nor martial arts like my brothers.

31:57.270 --> 31:58.480
My father pitied me,

31:58.830 --> 32:00.350
so he entrusted state affairs to them

32:00.368 --> 32:02.064
and allowed me to focus on recovering.

32:02.350 --> 32:04.270
Naturally, I came to appreciate

32:04.320 --> 32:05.760
these seemingly useless pursuits.

32:05.920 --> 32:06.590
Your Highness,

32:06.672 --> 32:08.160
the knowledge and skills one acquires

32:08.160 --> 32:09.270
are meant to serve the realm.

32:09.590 --> 32:10.830
You need not belittle yourself.

32:11.872 --> 32:13.310
If Heaven has denied me something,

32:13.320 --> 32:14.880
then I'll cherish what I have before me.

32:15.240 --> 32:17.200
Enjoy today's happiness while it lasts.

32:24.720 --> 32:25.750
I have something

32:25.936 --> 32:27.680
I'd like to present to Your Highness.

32:28.030 --> 32:28.680
What is it?

32:41.860 --> 32:44.740
(Rouge Ledger)

32:51.152 --> 32:53.200
This ledger records
the crimes of corrupt officials.

32:53.952 --> 32:55.240
Its contents are truly shocking.

32:56.480 --> 32:57.790
Where did you obtain it?

32:57.920 --> 32:59.160
By a fortunate turn of fate.

33:00.030 --> 33:01.400
I'm entrusting it to Your Highness

33:01.720 --> 33:03.110
because I believe

33:03.200 --> 33:04.680
that once you have the Rouge Ledger,

33:04.736 --> 33:07.136
you will sweep away
corruption with decisive resolve.

33:07.152 --> 33:09.744
With a heart as impartial as a scale
and justice as steadfast as a mountain.

33:09.750 --> 33:12.500
However deeply rooted the corrupt
officials and greedy eunuchs may be,

33:12.510 --> 33:13.790
you will show them no mercy

33:13.880 --> 33:15.120
and uproot them completely.

33:17.790 --> 33:19.240
We've only met twice,

33:19.550 --> 33:20.110
yet you

33:21.030 --> 33:22.200
trust me so completely?

33:22.400 --> 33:23.550
For me,

33:24.000 --> 33:24.880
one meeting is enough.

33:26.110 --> 33:28.160
Besides, I trust my own judgment.

33:28.256 --> 33:30.510
And I trust in Your Highness's
integrity even more.

33:36.030 --> 33:36.960
You are the first

33:36.960 --> 33:38.720
to place hope in me,

33:39.030 --> 33:40.310
a Crown Prince in name only.

33:41.070 --> 33:42.350
I will do everything in my power

33:42.790 --> 33:44.070
to live up to the faith

33:44.550 --> 33:45.440
you have placed in me.

33:53.260 --> 33:55.776
The commandery princess has returned
to the Duke of Wei's Manor.

33:56.992 --> 33:58.528
Your Highness expected this all along

33:58.830 --> 34:01.270
because you saw
that she trusted your character.

34:05.440 --> 34:06.640
She was only putting on an act.

34:07.070 --> 34:08.110
The real reason

34:08.110 --> 34:10.760
is that she knows every other prince
has powerful forces behind

34:10.770 --> 34:12.620
and would inevitably
protect their own allies.

34:12.630 --> 34:14.360
Only someone like me,
who left the palace at a young age,

34:14.360 --> 34:17.130
has no maternal family to rely on,
and stands apart from every faction,

34:17.150 --> 34:18.280
can remain impartial,

34:18.280 --> 34:19.280
without selfish motives,

34:19.344 --> 34:22.320
and bring every corrupt official
named in this ledger to justice.

34:22.480 --> 34:23.440
Along the way,

34:23.520 --> 34:25.984
I kept wondering how someone
could be so cold and rational.

34:26.110 --> 34:26.880
But today,

34:27.072 --> 34:29.456
I truly admire her unwavering
devotion to the greater good.

34:30.880 --> 34:31.480
Your Highness,

34:31.760 --> 34:34.670
Prince Yu followed the commandery
princess to the Duke of Wei's Manor

34:35.110 --> 34:36.510
with a cart full of gifts.

34:36.630 --> 34:37.710
The commandery princess

34:37.710 --> 34:38.832
accepted every single one.

34:39.312 --> 34:40.736
If he wants to give them, let him.

34:42.240 --> 34:43.710
Since Changyu offered them willingly,

34:43.880 --> 34:46.030
accepting them is
simply showing him courtesy.

34:46.360 --> 34:47.070
Exactly.

34:47.280 --> 34:48.070
In short,

34:48.144 --> 34:50.096
whatever the commandery princess
does is right.

34:50.150 --> 34:52.030
I know exactly what my brothers

34:52.030 --> 34:53.110
are thinking.

34:53.800 --> 34:55.030
Whoever marries Shen Xihe

34:55.030 --> 34:56.760
will gain control
of the northwestern army.

34:57.320 --> 34:58.890
Their intentions are far from honorable.

34:59.480 --> 35:01.150
How could I let them have their way?

35:03.230 --> 35:04.590
As for Changyu,

35:04.880 --> 35:06.710
it's time someone put him in his place.

35:09.140 --> 35:10.780
(Sixian Hall)

35:14.920 --> 35:15.690
After you, Changyu.

35:20.710 --> 35:22.150
The tea carries a subtle fragrance.

35:22.630 --> 35:23.440
I never expected

35:23.552 --> 35:25.552
Your Highness to be
so skilled in the art of tea.

35:26.400 --> 35:27.920
Tea is said to cure all ailments.

35:28.230 --> 35:30.440
With my health,
I can hardly do without it.

35:30.560 --> 35:32.832
The imperial capital is home
to many renowned physicians.

35:32.880 --> 35:34.280
I'm sure the day will come

35:34.300 --> 35:35.960
when Your Highness
makes a full recovery.

35:37.440 --> 35:39.296
Thank you for your kind words, Changyu.

35:47.030 --> 35:48.400
Speaking of the imperial capital,

35:48.816 --> 35:50.400
it truly is full of remarkable talents.

35:51.150 --> 35:51.920
Today,

35:52.440 --> 35:53.760
I met a musician

35:54.016 --> 35:55.936
who plays
the vertical konghou exquisitely.

35:56.840 --> 35:58.550
I still remember that your mother

35:58.624 --> 36:00.416
was especially fond
of the vertical konghou.

36:00.496 --> 36:03.590
So I invited you here today
to enjoy the performance together.

36:05.264 --> 36:07.150
This musician's skill
on the vertical konghou,

36:07.360 --> 36:08.800
though taught by you,

36:09.440 --> 36:11.480
falls far short of yours.

36:20.320 --> 36:23.280
Why does Your Highness say

36:23.710 --> 36:24.880
I taught this musician?

36:25.550 --> 36:27.190
What I have most is time.

36:27.280 --> 36:28.800
When it comes to the vertical konghou,

36:28.840 --> 36:30.000
I know a thing or two myself.

36:30.480 --> 36:31.880
The techniques at your fingertips

36:31.880 --> 36:32.710
are exactly the same.

36:33.360 --> 36:34.480
This musician

36:34.480 --> 36:35.920
is the qin instructor to

36:36.230 --> 36:37.590
Music Office dancer Bian Xianyi.

36:38.096 --> 36:40.480
Bian Xianyi's dancing is unrivaled
in the imperial capital.

36:40.880 --> 36:42.096
She is only eighteen,

36:42.144 --> 36:44.550
yet no matter how many princes
and noble heirs seek her hand,

36:44.630 --> 36:46.096
(Bian Xianyi, Dancer from Music Office)
she refuses them all.

36:46.630 --> 36:49.230
Meanwhile, you have yet
to take a principal wife

36:50.030 --> 36:52.590
and have twice declined Father's
arrangements for your marriage.

36:52.840 --> 36:55.150
Could it be the two of you
made a promise to each other?

36:56.400 --> 36:58.864
Why would Your Highness
make such baseless assumptions?

36:59.360 --> 37:01.960
If you wanted to
take Bian Xianyi as a concubine,

37:02.280 --> 37:03.360
it would be easy.

37:03.960 --> 37:05.070
Yet you chose not to.

37:05.360 --> 37:06.110
Could it be

37:06.208 --> 37:07.968
because you feared she would suffer?

37:09.440 --> 37:10.670
As a prince,

37:11.070 --> 37:12.550
you look beyond social rank.

37:13.150 --> 37:15.550
I truly admire that about you, Changyu.

37:16.110 --> 37:18.320
What exactly are you trying to imply?

37:19.070 --> 37:20.510
I recently heard a story.

37:22.096 --> 37:24.360
A man first marries a noble lady
as his principal wife.

37:24.360 --> 37:26.150
If she dies young,

37:26.280 --> 37:28.280
or loses her life
in some tragic accident,

37:28.336 --> 37:30.784
he can then marry the woman
he truly loves as his second wife,

37:30.800 --> 37:32.272
instead of making her a concubine.

37:32.510 --> 37:33.440
What a fanciful tale.

37:34.656 --> 37:36.480
Even if my principal wife
were to pass away,

37:36.720 --> 37:37.960
a woman from the Music Office

37:38.160 --> 37:39.872
could never become my second wife.

37:40.510 --> 37:43.280
You must have already
thought that through.

37:43.480 --> 37:44.960
If you married Shen Xihe

37:44.960 --> 37:46.630
and secured the northwestern army,

37:46.720 --> 37:48.480
with such a pillar
of the nation behind you,

37:48.528 --> 37:49.280
Father

37:50.320 --> 37:51.550
might very well approve.

37:51.648 --> 37:54.070
That's nothing but groundless
speculation. None of it is true.

37:55.230 --> 37:57.984
Besides, my feelings
for the commandery princess are sincere.

37:58.020 --> 37:59.140
She is the only one I love.

37:59.150 --> 38:00.960
Please don't question my sincerity.

38:01.150 --> 38:01.952
I'll take my leave.

38:02.070 --> 38:03.320
Then why

38:03.320 --> 38:05.550
are you wearing
Bian Xianyi's token of love?

38:05.584 --> 38:06.416
If I'm not mistaken,

38:06.420 --> 38:08.840
the embroidered pattern
on that sachet is an entwining lotus,

38:08.840 --> 38:11.380
the very same design as the forehead
adornment Bian Xianyi wears.

38:20.760 --> 38:21.920
You set me up?

38:22.840 --> 38:25.590
So you've been gathering leverage
against me all along?

38:29.360 --> 38:30.000
Changyu,

38:31.120 --> 38:33.090
I've spent years away
from the palace recovering.

38:33.630 --> 38:35.510
My brothers have never been close to me.

38:36.110 --> 38:37.360
The lonelier I felt,

38:37.660 --> 38:39.360
the more I cherished
the bond between us.

38:39.510 --> 38:41.100
I've always wanted what's best for you.

38:41.110 --> 38:42.360
Is that truly how you see me?

38:44.230 --> 38:45.480
It saddens me deeply.

38:47.320 --> 38:48.280
Go on.

38:48.550 --> 38:49.480
Keep acting.

38:50.400 --> 38:51.760
I may have wronged my wife,

38:51.856 --> 38:53.230
but I have never betrayed Xianyi.

38:53.480 --> 38:55.230
Nor have I betrayed
the woman I truly love.

38:56.800 --> 38:57.760
What's wrong with that?

38:58.400 --> 38:59.840
I'm the one who's gravely ill.

39:00.840 --> 39:02.880
Yet it seems
your condition is even worse.

39:04.030 --> 39:05.760
Such a thing, devoid of all humanity,

39:06.150 --> 39:06.920
must never be done.

39:07.480 --> 39:08.480
Then I simply

39:08.800 --> 39:09.880
won't admit to any of it.

39:12.000 --> 39:13.440
What can you possibly do to me?

39:24.110 --> 39:25.550
You think there's nothing I can do?

39:29.792 --> 39:31.180
Tea is best enjoyed for its flavor.

39:31.190 --> 39:32.544
A play is best enjoyed
from beginning to end.

39:32.560 --> 39:33.190
Your Highness.

39:34.000 --> 39:34.760
Your Highness.

39:34.760 --> 39:35.590
Your Highness!

39:35.800 --> 39:36.360
Your Highness!

39:36.510 --> 39:37.080
Your Highness!

39:37.760 --> 39:38.920
Your Highness, what's wrong?

39:42.360 --> 39:43.590
Your Highness!

39:43.800 --> 39:45.230
Prince Yu, what have you done?

39:45.232 --> 39:47.424
You've angered him so badly
that he coughed up blood!

39:47.440 --> 39:48.400
Someone!

39:48.590 --> 39:50.800
Prince Yu has made
the Crown Prince cough up blood!

39:50.880 --> 39:52.070
- He's coughing up blood!
- Your Highness!

39:52.070 --> 39:53.670
- Summon the Imperial Physician!
- Your Highness!

39:53.670 --> 39:54.800
The Crown Prince has coughed up blood!

39:54.800 --> 39:55.630
- Summon the Imperial Physician!
- Your Highness!

39:55.630 --> 39:57.110
- Quick, summon the Imperial Physician!
- Your Highness, wake up!

39:57.110 --> 39:57.880
- Your Highness!
- Summon the Imperial Physician!

39:57.880 --> 39:59.440
- Your Highness!
- His Highness has coughed up blood!

39:59.440 --> 40:00.960
Your Highness!

40:14.400 --> 40:17.424
Princes, if any of you admire
Commandery Princess Zhaoning,

40:17.488 --> 40:20.280
today is the perfect opportunity
to declare your feelings.

40:20.320 --> 40:22.710
This Incense Record
is the finest of its kind.

40:22.760 --> 40:24.880
I hope you will accept it.

40:24.960 --> 40:26.110
If I should win your favor,

40:26.440 --> 40:28.110
I swear to spend my life

40:28.128 --> 40:29.136
with only one wife.

40:29.190 --> 40:30.000
And...

40:30.000 --> 40:32.280
I, too, wish to ask
for your hand in marriage.

40:36.950 --> 40:39.890
♪I've hidden so many words♪

40:40.510 --> 40:43.310
♪Too reluctant to tell you♪

40:44.180 --> 40:51.150
♪So never uncover♪

40:51.340 --> 40:53.700
♪The sand that slips away
with one grasp♪

40:54.830 --> 40:57.560
♪The flower that withers
after one bloom♪

40:58.520 --> 41:03.860
♪Silently buried deep inside my heart♪

41:05.620 --> 41:08.440
♪Every answer I gave♪

41:09.240 --> 41:12.090
♪Was both bittersweet and absurd♪

41:12.880 --> 41:16.250
♪Hiding my tear-filled eyes
when I hurt you♪

41:16.510 --> 41:19.820
♪How hard it truly was?♪

41:22.790 --> 41:26.230
♪The wounds that healed
with just a little comfort♪

41:27.220 --> 41:29.550
♪The lies made whole
with a single embrace♪

41:30.820 --> 41:36.580
♪Pretending to be brave
as if I'd never been hurt♪

41:37.990 --> 41:41.120
♪It's a shame I never could♪

41:41.570 --> 41:44.580
♪Give you a moon in return♪

41:44.690 --> 41:51.330
♪With the same open heart you loved me♪

41:51.330 --> 41:55.000
♪I've crossed the wasteland of memories♪

41:55.870 --> 41:58.630
♪Never knowing I was lost♪

41:59.070 --> 42:02.200
♪Why don't you take me away?♪

42:02.640 --> 42:08.590
♪Lead me out of this endless game
of hide-and-seek♪

42:09.990 --> 42:13.540
♪You'll never♪

42:13.820 --> 42:23.290
♪Know how much I long to, long to♪
